{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ae3bdb41ffa4f52cab5ab5007169f39c7b07b9ffc4c305af9645f798b994793d","ja":"Extra edition 1　新たなるチャレンジ","zh":"Extra edition 1　全新的挑战","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f4b9619137cad6e787796c467c682b26c693687f7aa4890aa19d397397251e11","ja":"こ、ここが今日のライブ会場なんですね……。\nわ、私、急に緊張してきました……。","zh":"这、这里就是今天的演唱会会场啊……。\n我、我突然紧张起来了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ea048d83826136da78268ac65753f29355e3cb3f96e650f0e27365ae032eb85d","ja":"うう……ありさなんて、昨日からずっと\n緊張してて、全然眠れなかったです……。","zh":"呜呜……亚利沙从昨天开始就一直\n紧张，完全没睡着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f48422d6ef72da5c82b2dce365314b753404b32cb8aaf63c23f0694dbd519369","ja":"アタシも。なんか体が震えてきちゃったよ……。\nでも、しかたないよね。","zh":"我也是。不知怎么身体开始发抖了……。\n不过，没办法呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"810816e7024750ea2260a14ae734b27abaa77dd3bbf23f5443fdd5963d98b7fd","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーに許可取ってもらって、\nやっとできることになった路上ライブなんだし。","zh":"好不容易才得到●●●●制作人的许可，\n终于能办成的街头演出，","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1c2358fa0be2be22cb3b54b23a2f636e436f21e74bc480cafda0da87e7fb2016","ja":"それに、『≡君彩≡』がステップアップするための\nライブだから、絶対に成功させないと、ですよね。","zh":"而且，这是为了让『≡君彩≡』更进一步的\n演唱会，所以绝对要让它成功，对吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a05f4f0196d58fadbc564f8e6137c5e699a3d1bb393a9434decfaff9229a1189","ja":"だ、大丈夫です！　ありさ達、\n初ライブの後もずっとレッスンしてましたから……。","zh":"没、没事的！亚利沙她们，\n在首次演唱会之后也一直在练习……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"c61b51c4617ddec15cc4ddddaad53bfabc515e81c6f0f9d51e0870fb1763cf96","ja":"その成果を、\nここでバッチリ披露しちゃいましょう！","zh":"那份成果，\n就在这里完美展现吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"fea379de6cc7051f384ad845294a4a759c8c5f59b23c0636163a1462537f7a80","ja":"そ、そうですよね！\nそれじゃあ、さっそく音合わせをして……。","zh":"是、是这样呢！\n那么，赶紧开始调音……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ccfe68e3ff10f0d78dc581efb3afec9bc61997449dc755cec81712fec4e81102","ja":"あ、ちょっと待って。\nなんかアンプから音が出なくって……。","zh":"啊，等一下。\n不知怎么的，音箱没声音了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7cb2b8d25f525e13ca4d7b8e66f00e39ff3849f8ada66b6798c66b6671277cef","ja":"そういえば恵美さん、さっきから、電源オンオフ\nしたり、ケーブルつなぎ直したりしてますね。","zh":"说起来，惠美从刚才起就一会儿开关电源、一会儿重新连接线缆呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"60245607e71fd63f334d2afdb4e127702e29b42f46c3e98b603d6c01cb901aa2","ja":"うん。いろいろやってみてはいるんだけど……。","zh":"嗯。虽然也有在尝试各种事情……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_870.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1ed3be4be8884294a25c1c9358804d304d182c09114715a2363a56906ebd451d","ja":"えっ！　も、もしかして……、\n機材トラブルですかーっ！？","zh":"诶！　难、难道是……、\n设备故障了吗——！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
